<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Centocor Inc to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said it kept the near-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Centocor gained 1-3/16 to 31-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
